    <item>
      <title>LangChain 1.0核心迁移：从开源副业到AI Agent独角兽的架构深层进化与产业重塑</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/langchain-10ai-agent-20251027104004786-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Oct 2025 10:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
